msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid ""
"Sparkling is a clean, minimal and fully responsive WordPress theme suited to "
"blogs, news, magazines, business, portfolio and shop sites. It ships a full-"
"width front page slider, a call-to-action bar, social icon menu, author bio, "
"popular posts and enhanced category widgets, and four sidebar layouts you "
"can set globally or per post. Dozens of Customizer options cover colours, "
"typography, header, footer and layout, with a live preview. Built on "
"Bootstrap 3, the front end runs on plain JavaScript with no jQuery "
"dependency of its own. Sparkling is translation ready and ships with over "
"twenty translations, is WooCommerce ready, and works with bbPress, Contact "
"Form 7 and Jetpack."
msgstr ""

